WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.924 --> 00:00:05.092
The work an employee gave the business

2
00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:07.676
agent is the delegation record.

3
00:00:07.676 --> 00:00:11.260
Read its objective, scope and period first.

4
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:17.384
The agent reads the employee's instruction

5
00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:22.051
and decides its requests itself.

6
00:00:22.051 --> 00:00:28.321
Predict, then press 'Hand it to the agent'.

7
00:00:28.321 --> 00:00:34.554
Each request the agent sent gets one row of answers:

8
00:00:34.554 --> 00:00:38.150
firewall, sign-in, fixed rule,

9
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:42.226
approval-record rule, and Contexa.

10
00:00:42.226 --> 00:00:45.785
The next screen sets the work given,

11
00:00:45.785 --> 00:00:47.367
the request sent

12
00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:52.212
and the difference the engine named side by side,

13
00:00:52.212 --> 00:00:54.189
from its facts only.

14
00:00:54.189 --> 00:00:58.232
If Contexa asks the delegating person to check,

15
00:00:58.232 --> 00:01:01.586
you approve or reject as that employee.

16
00:01:01.586 --> 00:01:05.199
Send it yourself to see this run's result.
